@host = http://localhost:5082

### Liveness (process only, no dependency checks)
GET {{host}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness (includes PostgreSQL reachability)
GET {{host}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Create a delivery
POST {{host}}/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "customerName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "addressLine": "1 Analytical Way",
  "city": "London",
  "postalCode": "E1 6AN"
}

### Get a delivery
GET {{host}}/deliveries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
